<span class="ltx_bibblock">Can large vision language models read maps like a human?

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib83.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2503.14607</span>, 2025.

</span></li>
      
